    {
      "id": "S09-05",
      "name": "juicer-cc：同一事务两条消息同时访问同一 key",
      "spec_refs": ["9.4(b)", "9.4(c)", "9.4(d)", "7.1"],
      "layer": "core",
      "applies_to": ["juicer-cc"],
      "not_applicable": {
        "crdb": "CockroachDB 同一事务的两次发送批头时钟不同，同排序键同时到达的情形见 S05-06、S05-11",
        "spanner": "Spanner 一个事务在一个分片上只有一条数据消息（准备消息），同一事务不会有第二个标记落在同一 key 上"
      },
      "status": "active",
      "purpose": "事务 1 对 k1 的写与读排序键相同、同时到达：互不挡、都不算迟到、都不算乱序，各自登记控制类持有，在事务 1 提交执行完时一起结束。",
      "config": {
        "filter": {"mode": "hotspot", "K": 100, "S": 1, "idle_epochs": 3, "epoch_us": 1000000},
        "rules": "conflict-table",
        "H_us": 10000,
        "buffer": {"policy": "fixed", "W_us": 0},
        "late_policy": "queue",
        "queue_removal": "drain"
      },
      "inputs": [
        {"t_us": 100000, "type": "level1_abort", "txn": 90, "keys": ["k1"]},
        {
          "t_us": 200000,
          "type": "arrive",
          "msg": "p1",
          "txn": 91,
          "ts": 500,
          "ops": [{"key": "k1", "access": "write"}]
        },
        {
          "t_us": 300000,
          "type": "arrive",
          "msg": "p2",
          "txn": 92,
          "ts": 300,
          "ops": [{"key": "k1", "access": "write"}]
        },
        {"t_us": 1000000, "type": "epoch_end"},
        {
          "t_us": 1100000,
          "type": "arrive",
          "msg": "a",
          "txn": 1,
          "ts": 1000,
          "ops": [{"key": "k1", "access": "write"}]
        },
        {
          "t_us": 1100000,
          "type": "arrive",
          "msg": "b",
          "txn": 1,
          "ts": 1000,
          "ops": [{"key": "k1", "access": "read", "class": "control"}]
        },
        {
          "t_us": 1101000,
          "type": "arrive",
          "msg": "c",
          "txn": 2,
          "ts": 1100,
          "ops": [{"key": "k1", "access": "write"}]
        },
        {"t_us": 1102000, "type": "control_applied", "txn": 1, "kind": "commit", "keys": ["k1"]},
        {"t_us": 1103000, "type": "control_applied", "txn": 2, "kind": "commit", "keys": ["k1"]},
        {"t_us": 2000000, "type": "epoch_end"}
      ],
      "end_us": 2100000,
      "expect": {
        "startup": "accept",
        "deliveries": [
          {"msg": "p1", "t_us": 200000, "path": "direct"},
          {"msg": "p2", "t_us": 300000, "path": "direct"},
          {"msg": "a", "t_us": 1100000, "path": "queued"},
          {"msg": "b", "t_us": 1100000, "path": "queued"},
          {"msg": "c", "t_us": 1102000, "path": "queued"}
        ],
        "drops": [],
        "releases": {"k1": [{"msg": "a", "t_us": 1100000}, {"msg": "b", "t_us": 1100000}, {"msg": "c", "t_us": 1102000}]},
        "holds": [
          {"msg": "a", "key": "k1", "start_us": 1100000, "end": {"reason": "event", "t_us": 1102000}},
          {"msg": "b", "key": "k1", "start_us": 1100000, "end": {"reason": "event", "t_us": 1102000}},
          {"msg": "c", "key": "k1", "start_us": 1102000, "end": {"reason": "event", "t_us": 1103000}}
        ],
        "late": [],
        "queue_events": [{"t_us": 1000000, "key": "k1", "event": "created"}],
        "epochs": [{"index": 0, "ooo": {"k1": 1}}, {"index": 1, "ooo": {}}],
        "counters": {
          "intercepted": 5,
          "direct": 2,
          "queued_delivered": 3,
          "dropped": 0,
          "held_now": 0,
          "holds_created": 3,
          "hold_end": {"event": 3, "ttl": 0, "cancel": 0, "queue_deleted": 0},
          "late_queued": {"read": 0, "write": 0, "lock_read": 0},
          "late_bypass": {"read": 0, "write": 0, "lock_read": 0},
          "queues_max": 1,
          "queues_now": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "S09-06",
      "name": "第一级按“事务 × key”计一次中止",
      "spec_refs": ["9.4(d)", "2.1"],
      "layer": "adapter",
      "applies_to": ["juicer-cc", "crdb"],
      "not_applicable": {"spanner": "Spanner 一个事务在一个分片上只有一条数据消息，同一（事务, key）至多两个中止来源（失败回复与终止消息），构造不出既能区分“去重 / 不去重”又不在第一级平局的输入"},
      "status": "active",
      "purpose": "K = 1：k1 被两个事务各拒绝一次（计 2）；k2 被一个事务通过三个来源报告（两条失败回复、一条中止消息，计 1）。去重后 k2 进不了前 1，不被第二级观察，于是周期末提名 k1；若按来源计数（3 > 2），k2 会进前 1 并以更多的乱序被提名。",
      "config": {
        "filter": {"mode": "hotspot", "K": 1, "S": 1, "idle_epochs": 3, "epoch_us": 1000000},
        "rules": "conflict-table",
        "H_us": 10000,
        "buffer": {"policy": "fixed", "W_us": 0},
        "late_policy": "queue",
        "queue_removal": "drain"
      },
      "adapter_notes": {
        "juicer-cc": "中止来源走 juicer-cc 拦截器：失败回复（SelfAborted）与 Abort RPC 带的 key；协议用 d2PLWW。",
        "crdb": "中止来源走 CockroachDB 接入层：c1、c2 是同一事务对 k2 的两个批次（批头时钟 300、310）返回错误；中止消息用 EndTxn(commit=false) 或点名事务 3、状态 ABORTED 的 ResolveIntent。"
      },
      "inputs": [
        {
          "t_us": 100000,
          "type": "arrive",
          "msg": "a1",
          "txn": 1,
          "ts": 100,
          "ops": [{"key": "k1", "access": "write"}]
        },
        {"t_us": 101000, "type": "reply", "msg": "a1", "outcome": "ok"},
        {"t_us": 102000, "type": "control_arrive", "txn": 1, "kind": "abort", "keys": ["k1"]},
        {
          "t_us": 110000,
          "type": "arrive",
          "msg": "a2",
          "txn": 2,
          "ts": 200,
          "ops": [{"key": "k1", "access": "write"}]
        },
        {"t_us": 111000, "type": "reply", "msg": "a2", "outcome": "ok"},
        {"t_us": 112000, "type": "control_arrive", "txn": 2, "kind": "abort", "keys": ["k1"]},
        {
          "t_us": 200000,
          "type": "arrive",
          "msg": "c1",
          "txn": 3,
          "ts": 300,
          "ops": [{"key": "k2", "access": "write"}]
        },
        {
          "t_us": 200000,
          "type": "arrive",
          "msg": "c2",
          "txn": 3,
          "ts": 310,
          "ops": [{"key": "k2", "access": "write"}],
          "ts_by_system": {"juicer-cc": 300}
        },
        {"t_us": 201000, "type": "reply", "msg": "c1", "outcome": "failed"},
        {"t_us": 202000, "type": "reply", "msg": "c2", "outcome": "failed"},
        {"t_us": 203000, "type": "control_arrive", "txn": 3, "kind": "abort", "keys": ["k2"]},
        {
          "t_us": 400000,
          "type": "arrive",
          "msg": "d1",
          "txn": 21,
          "ts": 900,
          "ops": [{"key": "k2", "access": "write"}]
        },
        {
          "t_us": 401000,
          "type": "arrive",
          "msg": "d2",
          "txn": 22,
          "ts": 800,
          "ops": [{"key": "k2", "access": "write"}]
        },
        {
          "t_us": 402000,
          "type": "arrive",
          "msg": "d3",
          "txn": 23,
          "ts": 700,
          "ops": [{"key": "k2", "access": "write"}]
        },
        {
          "t_us": 500000,
          "type": "arrive",
          "msg": "e1",
          "txn": 24,
          "ts": 500,
          "ops": [{"key": "k1", "access": "write"}]
        },
        {
          "t_us": 501000,
          "type": "arrive",
          "msg": "e2",
          "txn": 25,
          "ts": 400,
          "ops": [{"key": "k1", "access": "write"}]
        },
        {"t_us": 1000000, "type": "epoch_end"}
      ],
      "end_us": 1100000,
      "expect": {
        "queue_events": [{"t_us": 1000000, "key": "k1", "event": "created"}],
        "epochs": [{"index": 0, "ooo": {"k1": 1}}]
      },
      "notes": "这是接入层场景：没有 level1_abort 事件，第一级的输入来自失败回复与中止消息，由各系统接入层按 2.1 声明的来源喂给第一级。期望依赖两套接入层都把“带 key 的中止消息”声明为中止来源（juicer-cc 与 CockroachDB 现在都如此）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09-07",
      "name": "Spanner：终止消息冲刷本事务被扣的消息，留下的孤儿标记被清除",
      "spec_refs": ["9.3", "1.2", "1.6"],
      "layer": "adapter",
      "applies_to": ["spanner"],
      "not_applicable": {"juicer-cc": "juicer-cc 没有提前投递路径（9.3 不适用）", "crdb": "CockroachDB 没有提前投递路径（9.3 不适用）"},
      "status": "active",
      "purpose": "事务 2 的准备消息在 k1 上被扣；事务 2 的 Abort 到达时，接入层按 9.3 允许的做法把它被扣的准备消息提前投递；留在堆里的孤儿标记必须被清除，不得放行成持有，之后的写不被它挡。",
      "config": {
        "filter": {"mode": "fixed", "managed_keys": ["k1"]},
        "rules": "conflict-table",
        "H_us": 10000,
        "buffer": {"policy": "fixed", "W_us": 0},
        "late_policy": "queue",
        "queue_removal": "drain"
      },
      "adapter_notes": {
